      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Heritage Society of Essex and Middle River preserves local history in a former 1920 fire station that once served as a courthouse.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://essexmuseum.com/welcome/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Middle River’s train station first appeared on the 1877 G.M., marking the town’s early connection to regional rail.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Middle_River%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Middle River Middle School now serves sixth through eighth graders, reflecting Maryland’s grade‑shift change.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
